---
layout: base.njk
title: 프로그램
permalink: /programs/
---
<section class="block tight" style="background:var(--navy-deep); color:#fff;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Programs</div>
    <h1 style="color:#fff;">운영 과정 소개</h1>
    <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); max-width:52ch;">{{ programs.intro }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Design Thinking</div>
      <h2>과정 기반 이론</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      {% for s in programs.design_thinking %}
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <h4>{{ s.step }} <span style="font-size:0.7em; color:var(--muted);">{{ s.en }}</span></h4>
        <p>{{ s.desc }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Differentiator</div>
      <h2>과정 차별성 &mdash; 자각 · 자행 · 자성 · 자득</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);">
      {% for d in programs.differentiators %}
      <div class="card">
        <span class="en">{{ d.hanja }}</span>
        <h3>{{ d.term }}</h3>
        <p>{{ d.desc }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Certification</div>
      <h2>등록민간자격 과정</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      {% for c in programs.certifications %}
      <div class="card">
        <span class="en">{{ c.name_en }}</span>
        <h3>{{ c.name_kr }} {{ c.level }}</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:10px;">{{ c.reg_no }}</p>
        <p>{{ c.desc }}</p>
        <p style="margin-top:14px; font-family:var(--serif); color:var(--navy); font-weight:700;">{{ c.cohorts }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block alt">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2>과정이 궁금하시다면</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);">등록 일정과 커리큘럼 상세 안내를 받아보세요.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn dark">문의하기</a>
  </div>
</section>
